{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22486","headline":"竹窗 · 白居易","name":"竹窗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常爱辋川寺，竹窗东北廊。\n一别十余载，见竹未曾忘。\n今春二月初，卜居在新昌。\n未暇作廐库，且先营一堂。\n开窗不糊纸，种竹不依行。\n意取北檐下，窗与竹相当。\n绕屋声淅淅，逼人色苍苍。\n烟通杳蔼气，月透玲珑光。\n是时三伏天，天气热如汤。\n独此竹窗下，朝回解衣裳。\n轻纱一幅巾，小簟六尺牀。\n无客尽日静，有风终夜凉。\n乃知前古人，言事颇谙详。\n清风北窗卧，可以傲羲皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}